// template: Crate Digger
// order: 1
// Boom bap at 90 under a global swing: an out-of-tune piano "sample" chopped and crushed
// like an old sampler, ghost snares at low velocity, a dusty recorded hat, a clap that
// doubles the backbeat, a round bass that follows the kick and a vinyl hiss whose filter
// jumps at random. The hook adds a gospel organ and a vocal chop, and the second hook a
// gospel choir and a crushed string stab; the second verse a harp flourish from the
// arpeggiator. The bridge drops the snare for the strings, the choir and a music-box
// bell. Style reference only; every melody is original.
title "Crate Digger"
tempo 90
key d minor
swing 0.16
kick:    kick       hard     x......x..x..... / x.........x..x.. / x......x..x..... / x......x..x...x?0.5.   | decay 0.32 | pitch 52 | click 0.4 | click-tone 1100 | drive 0.7 | grit 0.3 | gain 1.35
snare:   snare      fat      . . . . X . . x?0.5 . . . . X . . x?0.4 / . . . . X . . . . x?0.4 . . X . x?0.3 .   | velocity 0.3 | tune 0.35 | snap 0.7 | decay 0.25 | reverb room | gain 1.08
hat:     hat        dusty    x . x x?0.4 x . x . x . x x?0.4 x . x x?0.3 / x . x x?0.4 x . x x?0.4 x . x x?0.4 x . x .   | velocity 1 | decay 0.1 | pan 0.2 | gain 2
bass:    bass       round    d2 ~ ~ . . . . d2 . . d2 ~ . . c2 . / bb1 ~ ~ . . . . . . . bb1 ~ . bb1 . . / g1 ~ ~ . . . . g1 . . g1 ~ . . bb1 . / a1 ~ ~ . . . . a1 . . a1 ~ . . e2 .   | cutoff 500 | decay 0.5 | drive 0.4 | duck 0.3 | gain 1.35
sample:  piano      honky    Dm9 ~ ~ ~ . . Dm9 ~ . . . Dm9 . . Dm9 . / Bbmaj9 ~ ~ ~ . . Bbmaj9 ~ . . . Bbmaj9 . . . . / Gm9 ~ ~ ~ . . Gm9 ~ . . . Gm9 . . Gm9 . / A7sus4 ~ ~ ~ . . A7sus4 ~ A7 ~ ~ ~ A7 . A7 .   | free | voicing open | inversion 1 | velocity 0.7 | crush 0.3 | lowpass 3400 | highpass 180 | eq-low -8 | reverb room | gain 0.47
vinyl:   noise      pink     x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~                                   | cutoff rand(1/16) 1500..9000 | crush 0.6 | highpass 900 | gain 0.16
organ:   organ      church   Dm9 ~ ~ ~ / Bbmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Gm9 ~ ~ ~ / A7sus4 ~ A7 ~    | free | voicing spread | lowpass 2400 | eq-low -4 | duck 0.3 | reverb hall | gain 0.41
chop:    vox        ooh      . . a4 ~ c5 . a4 . . . g4 ~ f4 . . . / . . f4 ~ g4 . a4 . . . d4 ~ ~ . . . / . . bb4 ~ a4 . g4 . . . f4 ~ g4 . . . / . . e4 ~ ~ ~ . . g4 ~ ~ ~ . . . .   | crush 0.25 | highpass 400 | delay 1/8 | reverb plate | gain 0.47
harp:    harp       concert  Dm9 ~ . . . . . . / Bbmaj9 ~ . . . . . . / Gm9 ~ . . . . . . / A7sus4 ~ . . A7 ~ . .   | free | arp up | arp-rate 1/24 | arp-octaves 2 | reverb hall | pan -0.3 | gain 0.54
fill:    tom        boom     .... / .... / .... / .... .... ..x. x.xx              | tune 0.3 | reverb room | gain 0.68
clap:    clap       roomy    . . . . x . . . . . . . x . . . / . . . . x . . . . . . . x . . .   | reverb room | pan 0.1 | gain 0.74
strings: strings    ensemble Dm9 ~ . . . . . . / Bbmaj9 ~ . . . . . . / Gm9 ~ . . . . . . / A7sus4 ~ . . A7 ~ . .   | free | voicing open | attack 0.02 | release 0.3 | crush 0.25 | lowpass 3200 | highpass 250 | reverb room | gain 0.47
choir:   choir      gospel   Dm9 ~ ~ ~ / Bbmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Gm9 ~ ~ ~ / A7sus4 ~ A7 ~   | free | voicing spread | attack 0.3 | release 1.2 | lowpass 3000 | reverb hall | gain 0.3
bell:    bell       toy      d6 . a5 . f5 . a5 . / d6 . bb5 . f5 . bb5 a5 / g5 . bb5 . d6 . c6 bb5 / a5 . c#6 . e6 . c#6 a5   | free | velocity 0.6 | delay 3/16 | reverb hall | pan 0.25 | gain 0.54
section intro    sample vinyl
section verse    kick snare hat bass sample vinyl | loop
section hook     kick snare clap hat bass sample organ chop vinyl
section verse2   kick snare hat bass sample harp fill vinyl
section hook2    kick snare clap hat bass sample organ choir strings chop vinyl
section bridge   kick clap bass strings choir bell vinyl
section outro    sample vinyl
song intro 8, verse 16, hook 8, verse2 16, hook2 8, bridge 8, verse 16, hook2 8, outro 8
